# Wave W17-J (Route 45): fall sand — stepped falling-road sand, loose sand lying in shallow steps down the slope, each step lip shadowed and its tread lit — split from Arden’s ledgefloor slabs: loose stepped sand, not laid stone (design-authorised pale sand running end to end, Cragmoor down to Route 46).
